    <section id="features" style="border-top: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 56px 48px 0">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #7fd88f; font-weight: 600">EVERYTHING IT DOES</p>
      <h2 style="margin: 0 0 24px; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em">More than a yes or a no.</h2>
    </section>
    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); margin: 0 48px 56px; border-top: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-left: 1px solid #1c1c1c">
      <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #7fd88f">AGENT HOOKS</p><p style="margin: 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 15px">Claude Code, Codex and Cursor: every command, file read and write, web fetch and MCP call is checked.</p></div>
      <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #7fd88f">A REAL SHELL PARSER</p><p style="margin: 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 15px">Base64, $'…', variables, globs, braces, symlinks, heredocs, $(…), and commands hidden in ssh, git and watch.</p></div>
      <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #7fd88f">OS SANDBOXES</p><p style="margin: 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 15px">One policy writes each agent's sandbox, or runs the whole agent in one with moat run.</p></div>
      <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #7fd88f">NETWORK ALLOWLIST</p><p style="margin: 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 15px">Only the hosts the policy lists. Cloud metadata services are refused.</p></div>
      <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #7fd88f">SECRETS BROKER</p><p style="margin: 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 15px">The agent holds a placeholder; the real token goes to one host only.</p></div>
      <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #7fd88f">SESSION TAINT</p><p style="margin: 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 15px">After a session reads a secret or untrusted content, the risky calls that follow ask.</p></div>
      <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #7fd88f">SELF-PROTECTION</p><p style="margin: 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 15px">The agent cannot edit the rules, approve itself or uninstall. A changed policy blocks every call until you review.</p></div>
      <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #7fd88f">SEE WHAT HAPPENED</p><p style="margin: 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 15px">moat, moat show, replay and report. Every decision in a hash-chained log you can export and verify.</p></div>
      <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #7fd88f">TEAM RULES</p><p style="margin: 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 15px">Commit .moat/policy.yaml: its deny and ask rules apply to everyone, its allows after moat trust.</p></div>
      <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #7fd88f">POLICY TOOLS</p><p style="margin: 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 15px">Check any command first, edit with a diff, upgrade without losing your changes.</p></div>
      <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #7fd88f">FAILS CLOSED</p><p style="margin: 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 15px">If its own check errors or hangs, the call is blocked, not waved through.</p></div>
      <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 24px"><p style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; color: #7fd88f">MOATBENCH</p><p style="margin: 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 15px">Score OpenMoat, or any agent hook, against the bundled attack and workflow scenarios.</p></div>
    </div>

    <section id="your-way" style="border-top: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 56px 48px">
      <p style="margin: 0 0 12px; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; color: #7fd88f; font-weight: 600">STAYS OUT OF YOUR WAY</p>
      <h2 style="margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: 36px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em">One command when it gets in the way.</h2>
      <p style="margin: 0 0 24px; color: #a3a3a3; max-width: 680px">Run these in your own terminal. Agents are denied all of them, so a prompt injection cannot approve itself.</p>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); border-top: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-left: 1px solid #1c1c1c">
        <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 22px"><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-weight: 600">An ask you want to approve</p><code style="display: block; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; background: #111; border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; color: #ededed">moat allow --last</code><p style="margin: 10px 0 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 14px">for this session, or --always for good</p></div>
        <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 22px"><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-weight: 600">Another repository or folder</p><code style="display: block; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; background: #111; border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; color: #ededed">moat allow --dir ~/work/lib</code><p style="margin: 10px 0 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 14px">read and edit there; secrets stay denied</p></div>
        <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 22px"><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-weight: 600">A site the agent needs</p><code style="display: block; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; background: #111; border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; color: #ededed">moat allow --site docs.rs</code><p style="margin: 10px 0 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 14px">one exact host</p></div>
        <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 22px"><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-weight: 600">An API token</p><code style="display: block; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; background: #111; border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; color: #ededed">moat secret add gh</code><p style="margin: 10px 0 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 14px">the agent gets a placeholder, not the token</p></div>
        <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 22px"><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-weight: 600">What did the agent do?</p><code style="display: block; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; background: #111; border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; color: #ededed">moat</code><p style="margin: 10px 0 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 14px">today's decisions, and anything that needs you</p></div>
        <div style="border-right: 1px solid #1c1c1c; border-bottom: 1px solid #1c1c1c; padding: 22px"><p style="margin: 0 0 10px; font-weight: 600">Take it all out</p><code style="display: block; font-family: 'Geist Mono', monospace; background: #111; border: 1px solid #262626; border-radius: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; color: #ededed">moat uninstall</code><p style="margin: 10px 0 0; color: #a3a3a3; font-size: 14px">every settings file back as it was</p></div>
      </div>
    </section>

